<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Kestrel Intelligence Engine v5.1 — Client Presentation Deck</title>
<style>
  :root {
    --bg-main: #07090e;
    --bg-card: #0e131f;
    --bg-card-subtle: #141b2d;
    --border-cyan: #00e5ff;
    --border-subtle: #1e293b;
    --text-primary: #f8fafc;
    --text-secondary: #94a3b8;
    --text-muted: #64748b;
    --accent-green: #00ff88;
    --accent-red: #ff2a55;
    --accent-amber: #f59e0b;
    --accent-purple: #c084fc;
    --accent-cyan: #00e5ff;
  }

  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  body {
    font-family: 'Segoe UI', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Roboto, sans-serif;
    background: var(--bg-main);
    color: var(--text-primary);
    line-height: 1.6;
    padding: 40px 20px;
  }

  .container {
    max-width: 1080px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  header {
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border-cyan);
    padding-bottom: 24px;
    margin-bottom: 36px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-end;
  }

  .brand h1 {
    font-size: 32px;
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: -0.5px;
    color: var(--accent-cyan);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .brand p {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 15px;
    margin-top: 4px;
  }

  .badge-vip {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(0, 229, 255, 0.2), rgba(0, 255, 136, 0.2));
    border: 1px solid var(--border-cyan);
    color: var(--accent-cyan);
    padding: 8px 16px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }

  .grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));
    gap: 24px;
    margin-bottom: 36px;
  }

  .card {
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 24px;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .card::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
    height: 2px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--border-cyan), transparent);
  }

  .card h2 {
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    color: #fff;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .card p {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 14px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .pattern-tag {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 4px 10px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-family: 'Consolas', monospace;
    margin: 4px 4px 4px 0;
  }

  .tag-bull { background: rgba(0, 255, 136, 0.15); border: 1px solid var(--accent-green); color: var(--accent-green); }
  .tag-bear { background: rgba(255, 42, 85, 0.15); border: 1px solid var(--accent-red); color: var(--accent-red); }
  .tag-neutral { background: rgba(0, 229, 255, 0.15); border: 1px solid var(--accent-cyan); color: var(--accent-cyan); }

  .metric-box {
    background: var(--bg-card-subtle);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 14px;
    margin-top: 12px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .metric-label { font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-secondary); }
  .metric-val { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; color: var(--text-primary); }

  .comparison-table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin-top: 16px;
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  .comparison-table th, .comparison-table td {
    padding: 12px 16px;
    text-align: left;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
  }

  .comparison-table th {
    background: var(--bg-card-subtle);
    color: var(--accent-cyan);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .highlight {
    color: var(--accent-green);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .footer {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    padding-top: 24px;
    margin-top: 48px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 13px;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">
  <header>
    <div class="brand">
      <h1>🦅 KESTREL ENGINE v5.1</h1>
      <p>Institutional Client Deck — Deep Candlestick Intelligence & Autonomous Execution</p>
    </div>
    <div class="badge-vip">Executive Client Edition</div>
  </header>

  <div class="grid">
    <div class="card">
      <h2>🕯️ Candlestick & Price Action Engine</h2>
      <p>Continuous algorithmic scanning of 12+ institutional single- and multi-bar candle patterns on confirmed closes.</p>
      <div>
        <span class="pattern-tag tag-bull">▲ Bullish Engulfing (92%)</span>
        <span class="pattern-tag tag-bull">▲ Hammer / Pin Bar (88%)</span>
        <span class="pattern-tag tag-bull">▲ Morning Star (95%)</span>
        <span class="pattern-tag tag-bear">▼ Bearish Engulfing (92%)</span>
        <span class="pattern-tag tag-bear">▼ Shooting Star (88%)</span>
        <span class="pattern-tag tag-bear">▼ Evening Star (95%)</span>
        <span class="pattern-tag tag-neutral">📦 Inside Bar Compression (78%)</span>
        <span class="pattern-tag tag-neutral">⚡ Fair Value Gap (FVG)</span>
      </div>
      <div class="metric-box">
        <span class="metric-label">Candle Confluence Contribution:</span>
        <span class="metric-val highlight">12% Direct Vote</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <h2>⚖️ Candle Anatomy & Pressure Metrics</h2>
      <p>Real-time mathematical decomposition of live candle forces to detect institutional accumulation or distribution.</p>
      <div class="metric-box">
        <span class="metric-label">Wick Rejection Force:</span>
        <span class="metric-val" style="color:var(--accent-cyan);">Buying vs Selling %</span>
      </div>
      <div class="metric-box">
        <span class="metric-label">Relative Bar Volatility:</span>
        <span class="metric-val">Expansion (&gt;1.4x) / Squeeze (&lt;0.6x)</span>
      </div>
      <div class="metric-box">
        <span class="metric-label">Live Candle Countdown:</span>
        <span class="metric-val highlight">Exact MM:SS Remaining</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <h2>🖥️ Client Presentation Mode (HUD)</h2>
      <p>One-click interactive toggle designed specifically for client walkthroughs and professional pitch sessions.</p>
      <div class="metric-box">
        <span class="metric-label">Executive Minimized Mode:</span>
        <span class="metric-val highlight">[ 🗕 MIN ] Floating Sleek Bar</span>
      </div>
      <div class="metric-box">
        <span class="metric-label">Pro Full Analytical Mode:</span>
        <span class="metric-val">[ 🗖 EXP ] 10-Module Suite</span>
      </div>
      <div class="metric-box">
        <span class="metric-label">Chart Aesthetics:</span>
        <span class="metric-val" style="color:var(--accent-cyan);">Obsidian &amp; Neon 3D Cyber</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="card" style="margin-bottom: 36px;">
    <h2>💎 Institutional Key Levels vs. Cluttered Heatmaps</h2>
    <p>Upgraded to clean, non-intrusive institutional levels that preserve chart readability for your clients.</p>
    <table class="comparison-table">
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Feature</th>
          <th>Standard / Legacy Cluttered Overlay</th>
          <th>Kestrel v5.1 Institutional Key Levels</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td>Chart Obstruction</td>
          <td style="color:var(--accent-red);">25 solid neon bands covering candles</td>
          <td class="highlight">100% Transparent, Unobscured Candles</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Display Density</td>
          <td>Dozens of irrelevant historical levels</td>
          <td class="highlight">Top 2 Supply + Top 2 Demand Levels only</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Style &amp; Precision</td>
          <td>Heavy colored rectangles</td>
          <td class="highlight">Thin dashed institutional lines + Right-side price badges</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Interactive Control</td>
          <td>Static clutter</td>
          <td class="highlight">1-Click Toggle between Clean Levels, Outlines, or Off</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h2>🦅 Kestrel Multi-Dimensional Intelligence Overview</h2>
    <p>Kestrel blends 9 institutional intelligence vectors to deliver unmatched signal conviction:</p>
    <div class="grid" style="margin-bottom:0; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));">
      <div class="metric-box">
        <span class="metric-label">1. MTF Confluence</span>
        <span class="metric-val">M5 to D1 (5 Timeframes)</span>
      </div>
      <div class="metric-box">
        <span class="metric-label">2. Model Consensus</span>
        <span class="metric-val">5 Strategy Clusters</span>
      </div>
      <div class="metric-box">
        <span class="metric-label">3. Candlestick Engine</span>
        <span class="metric-val highlight">12+ Patterns + FVG</span>
      </div>
      <div class="metric-box">
        <span class="metric-label">4. Smart Key Levels</span>
        <span class="metric-val">Supply &amp; Demand Pools</span>
      </div>
      <div class="metric-box">
        <span class="metric-label">5. News Protection</span>
        <span class="metric-val">ForexFactory Live Filter</span>
      </div>
      <div class="metric-box">
        <span class="metric-label">6. Pattern Correlation</span>
        <span class="metric-val">Pearson Lookback 500b</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="footer">
    <div>CapeChain Labs &copy; 2026 | Kestrel Autonomous Smart Trading Platform</div>
    <div>Confidential — For Client &amp; Investor Demonstrations</div>
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
